SUMMARY:Impromptu: Advanced B Ride (16-18 Mph)LC Butter Side Up (23R)
DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\nRide leader: Vern Wheeler
 \nSweep: Volunteer to Sweep!\nAnticipated Average Pace: (16-18 mph)\nRoute
 : [https://routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-butter-side-up-23r/](https:
 //routes.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/lc-butter-side-up-23r/)\n\nThis is an A
 dvanced B ride. We will be keeping a B+ pace for this ride. The ride leade
 r will ride at the advertised average speed or the pace of the group. This
  is intended to be a group ride with a no-drop rule as the main goal. The 
 ride leader will do his/her best to keep the group together with occasiona
 l regroupings.\n\nPlease do not join this ride if you are not willing to r
 ide with the group. If you exceed the posted pace\, you will be riding by 
 yourself and encouraged to join a faster group. If maintaining a 16-18 mph
  average is beyond your current ability level\, please consider joining a 
 slower ride first.\nHelmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Please bring water 
 and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO2 inflator).\nTo
  eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, we require LBC Club mem
 bership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Being on Meetup does not 
 mean you are a club member. Join here [Member Signup](https://www.lancaste
 rbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id=257148)\nYour RSVP is your a
 greement to abide by the club's [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbik
 eclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\nGuidan
 ce if an incident occurs: [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net
 /content.aspx?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
